      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;ug-krishnamurti-the-divine-anarchist-mariana-caplan&#34;&gt;U.G. Krishnamurti: The Divine Anarchist Mariana Caplan&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Source: &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/discourses/teachers/ugk_caplan.htm&#34;&gt;TW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Author: Mariana Caplan&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Visit Mariana&amp;rsquo;s website &amp;lsquo;&lt;a href=&#34;http://www.realspirituality.com/index.html&#34;&gt;Real Spirituality&lt;/a&gt;&amp;rsquo; for details of her books and counselling service and to read some of her past articles and book chapters.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Possibly her best-known book is &amp;lsquo;Halfway Up the Mountain: The Error of Premature Claims to Enlightenment&amp;rsquo;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0934252912/fromtheunreat-20&#34;&gt;&lt;figure class=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/images/halfway.jpg&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/images/halfway.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;book cover&#34; title=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &#xA;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Purchase from &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0934252912/fromtheunreat-20&#34;&gt;US&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.co.uk/exec/obidos/ASIN/0934252912/thespiritupat-21&#34;&gt;UK&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Read my own &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/reading/read_related.htm#caplan&#34;&gt;recommendations&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;(This article was written in 2002 for publication online, and is being published here in honor of the life and passing of U.G. Krishnamurti, who left his body on March 22, 2007, in Vallecrosia, Italy)&lt;/p&gt;</description>
